1. Install Library
  - DHT sensor library (Adafruit)
  - LiquidCrystalI2C (Frank de Bruijn)
  - ESPAsyncWebServer (lacamera)
  - AsyncTCP (dvarrel)

Step 2 — Setting Board ESP32
Tools → Board → ESP32 Arduino
Pilih WeMos D1 Mini ESP32 atau ESP32 Dev Module
Tools → Port → pilih COM yang muncul (setelah ESP32 disambung USB)

Step 3 — Upload Sketch
Klik tombol Upload (panah kanan) atau Ctrl+U
Tunggu sampai muncul Done uploading

Step 4 — Upload File Web (LittleFS)
Ini penting! File HTML, CSS, JS harus diupload terpisah:
Tools → ESP32 Sketch Data Upload
Tunggu sampai selesai

Step 5 — Cek IP Address
Buka Serial Monitor (Ctrl+Shift+M)
Set baud rate 115200
Reset ESP32 → lihat IP yang muncul
Contoh: 192.168.1.105

Step 6 — Buka Web Dashboard
Buka browser
Ketik IP tadi → 192.168.1.105
Dashboard muncul dengan data sensor real-time!

-------------------------------------------------------------------

    PIN KE ESP

DHT21 = GPIO 4
Soil Sensor = GPIO 34
Relay 1(Fan) = GPIO 26
Relay 2(Pompa) = GPIO 27
LCD (SDA) = GPIO 21
LCD (SCL) = GPIO 22

Suhu > 35C = Fan ON, Kelembaban Tanah < 40% = Pompa ON.
